flowchart TD
    A[Input: LaTeX Content] --> B[Strip Comments]
    B --> C[Extract Sections]
    C --> D{Sections Found?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Build Sections from Balanced Titles]
    D -->|No| F[Extract Sections Fallback with Regex]
    E --> G[Process Sections]
    F --> G
    G --> H[For Each Section]
    H --> I[Parse Section Recursively to Chunks]
    I --> J[Clean Content: Remove Tables, Figures, etc.]
    J --> K[Create TextChunk: id, title, content, level, parent_id]
    K --> L[Add to Chunks List]
    L --> M{More Sections?}
    M -->|Yes| H
    M -->|No| N[Output: ParsedTex with Chunks]